Subject: LLVM optimizer safety guards (InstCombine, SROA, PassBuilderPipelines)
Upstream-Base: LLVM main (1bd1774757f8fb19c0a06f84cbb53076b75eafbb)
Fil-C-Head: cede3de02b42b58a14acc9ce39c9894ab952a915 (branch deluge)

Disables or restricts InstCombine pointer/integer folds and PassBuilder
passes that violate Fil-C capability semantics, and adapts SROA alloca
partitioning for Fil-C word-phase alignment and OOB handling.

Fil-C-Origin-Commits (8):
  65fee96a6c7aac5170c8877a41a95aa0750deb80 2026-08-09 Fix #294.
  e8f4bfb24011a429056659e9f47fba9eec8a0459 2026-07-17 Fix #265
  ea0fafc83c46e3f8da8e133a746ea340eec68ace 2026-01-23 Revert f7e5ea4945e59d95cecc856482fdfca742725e4c because it introduced a capability loss bug, which is captured in the new badsroa6 test.
  a0787133211ec43ecd820d6df71162e510767cf5 2026-01-07 Remove some debugging stuff
  f7e5ea4945e59d95cecc856482fdfca742725e4c 2026-01-07 Fix SROA's handling of inttoptr/ptrtoint casts.
  c1776a228053da051199ea171c82384f028290d0 2025-12-06 Apply @djb's patch to remove some optimizations that don't measurably improve perf, but do measurably reduce constant-timeyness of crypto. 0.35% speed-up on PizBench9018 (i.e. it's neutral).
  d950cf057e4764ec3605b75ad8855e054c55c233 2025-09-14 Fixed a bunch of cases of obvious UB causing LLVM to optimize an operation that should have panicked into some kind of no-op. Resolves issue #56.
  d292f5dbb951d549fc9b053950d5a330d532b361 2025-08-22 Rebase Fil-C to clang/llvm 20.1.8

Exceptions:
  - llvm/lib/Transforms/Scalar/SROA.cpp: stripped `static constexpr bool verbose = false;` and all `if (verbose)` debug-logging blocks; all functional Fil-C SROA logic is preserved verbatim.

Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-20.1.8 -> llvmorg-21.1.8):
  - PassBuilderPipelines.cpp: context updated for TailCallElimPass PGO argument and invokeVectorizerEndEPCallbacks.
  - InstCombineAndOrXor.cpp & InstCombineMulDivRem.cpp: adapted removed fold blocks to LLVM 21's 2-argument computeKnownBits().
  - InstructionCombining.cpp: adapted isAllocSiteRemovable Fil-C early exit from `return false` to `return std::nullopt` (return type changed to std::optional<ModRefInfo> in LLVM 21).

Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-21.1.8 -> llvmorg-22.1.8):
  - PassBuilderPipelines.cpp: context updated for simplified createFunctionToLoopPassAdaptor() and LTOPhase parameter on addVectorPasses().
  - InstCombineAndOrXor.cpp & InstCombineShifts.cpp: adapted removed fold blocks to LLVM 22's createSelectInstWithUnknownProfile() helper.
  - InstCombineCalls.cpp: context updated for MI->setLength((uint64_t)0).
  - SROA.cpp: adapted to LLVM 22's extracted selectPartitionType() and IsIntegerWideningViable/ProtectedFieldDisc parameters.


Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-22.1.8 -> llvmorg-23.1.6):
  - PassBuilderPipelines.cpp: context updated for removed !Level.isOptimizingForSize() guards around LibCallsShrinkWrapPass and PGOMemOPSizeOpt.
  - InstCombineAndOrXor.cpp & InstCombineMulDivRem.cpp: updated deleted select-creating folds for Profcheck / createSelectInstWithUnknownProfile changes in LLVM 23.
  - InstructionCombining.cpp: context updated for SmallVectorImpl<Instruction *> parameter in isAllocSiteRemovable().
  - SROA.cpp: adapted Skew handling to AllocaSliceRewriter's new NewAllocaTy parameter, selectPartitionType's AggregateToVector argument, and rewritePartition's std::pair<AllocaInst *, uint64_t> return type.


Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-23.1.6 -> LLVM main 1bd1774757f8):
  - PassBuilderPipelines.cpp: context updated for Opts.enable_constraint_elimination and std::optional LicmMssaOptCap dereference.
  - InstCombine{AndOrXor,Calls,Shifts}.cpp: updated removed select-creating folds for setExplicitlyUnknownBranchWeightsIfProfiled / Profcheck changes.
  - InstructionCombining.cpp: context updated for MaxUsers parameter in isAllocSiteRemovable().

